### запрос на Delete CRU(D)
DELETE {{hostname}}/cameras/4


### запрос на Update CR(U)D

UPDATE {{hostname}}/cameras/4
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "brand": "Nikon",
  "release_year": 2020,
  "megapixels": "20.4",
  "sensor_type": "Full_Frame",
  "interchangeable_lens": true,
  "price": 900000
}

